ICOSale.setNewRound
├── when called by the owner with valid times, non-zero price & cap, and no prior round
│   └── it creates round with id 0, sets fields, marks active, soldTokens = 0, and emits NewRoundSet with correct args
├── when called by the owner with valid params and a prior active round
│   ├── it deactivates the previous round (sets active = false)
│   ├── it increments round id (newId = currentRoundId + 1)
│   └── it creates the new round with correct fields and emits NewRoundSet
├── when newId >= Constants.MAX_ROUNDS
│   └── it reverts with CapReached
├── when timeframe is invalid (_startTime == 0 or _startTime < block.timestamp or _endTime == 0 or _startTime >= _endTime)
│   └── it reverts with InvalidTimeframe
├── when _tokenPrice == 0 or _capTotal == 0
│   └── it reverts with ZeroAmount
└── when called by a non-owner
    └── it reverts with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
